        "slidesOrder": 3,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "diagram",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "clean",
          "accent": "blue",
          "decor": false
        },
        "presenterNotes": "Tickets. This is me: I bring intent — epics, stories — and an agent (the admiral, via /fleet-commission) drafts each one to the Definition of Ready: four-section body, testable acceptance criteria, dependencies wired as blocked-by edges. They land in Jira as To Do. I review, refine, prioritise — and the loop goes round until the backlog is Ready."
      },
      "name": "Tickets"
    },
    {
      "id": "XAHDJ6s9zQOuRhq4j9-ts",
      "type": "text",
