      "index": "b2a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1441534858,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1773048801,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795209339586,
      "created": 1795209339586,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 6,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "diagram",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "clean",
          "accent": "blue",
          "decor": false
        },
        "presenterNotes": "Merge. The merge driver (the sailor) sweeps the open MR. It reads the MR's state and acts: conflicts → rebase, review threads → reply and apply the fixes found, failed CI → repair, clean → arm auto-merge. Then it sleeps — roughly a minute — and sweeps again. If something crosses its threshold, it escalates to triage, same as the worker. Once the forge's gates pass — pipeline, threads, approvals — the forge merges it."
      },
      "name": "Merge"
    },
    {
      "id": "E7xvus8SfDoSden3VdWUe",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 15970,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1080,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 46604746,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1242314710,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795209339643,
      "created": 1795209339643,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 7,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "diagram",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "clean",
          "accent": "blue",
          "decor": false
        },
        "presenterNotes": "Done. The merged MR has met the Definition of Done. On its next tick reconcile reaps it: Jira → Done, sessions end, the worktree is freed, and the ledger records one event. Closing the ticket clears blockers for its dependents — so the captain's next pass has a new frontier, and the line keeps moving."
      },
      "name": "Done"
    },
